    <description>WU10-14b (Abbey 2026-09-04 &apos;READ THIS ONE&apos; tab). Rebuilds the seven people mirrors on a study - PI, Sub-I, Lead CRC, Back-Up CRC, Blinded Raters, Unblinded CRCs, Unblinded Pharmacist - from its Care Program Team Member rows. WU10-15d guard: a mirror is only overwritten when at least one member of that role exists, so names typed by hand (pilot load) survive until the team is entered properly. Called by EM_Study_Team_Mirror_Save and EM_Study_Team_Mirror_Delete. var_ExcludeId lets the before-delete trigger leave out the row that is about to go. Each mirror is comma separated and capped at 255 characters.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>fx_BackupCRC</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(LEN({!var_BackupCRC}) &gt; 2, LEFT(LEFT({!var_BackupCRC}, LEN({!var_BackupCRC}) - 2), 255), BLANKVALUE({!Get_Study.EM_Backup_CRC__c}, &quot;&quot;))</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fx_BlindedRaters</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(LEN({!var_BlindedRaters}) &gt; 2, LEFT(LEFT({!var_BlindedRaters}, LEN({!var_BlindedRaters}) - 2), 255), BLANKVALUE({!Get_Study.EM_Blinded_Raters__c}, &quot;&quot;))</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
